{"conversation_id":"b014f137-1ca5-4c0c-9cc6-8b1ae46dd022","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Root Cause\n\nIn [`pkg/cache.py`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/cache.py#L4-L5), [`_key`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/cache.py#L4-L5) generated the cache key via:\n```python\ndef _key(spec):\n    return tuple(spec.items())\n```\nBecause Python dictionary iteration order depends on insertion order, specifications with identical key-value pairs inserted in different orders (such as `spec_a = {\"region\": \"eu\", \"tier\": \"gold\"}` vs. `spec_b = {\"tier\": \"gold\", \"region\": \"eu\"}`) generated distinct tuples (`(('region', 'eu'), ('tier', 'gold'))` vs. `(('tier', 'gold'), ('region', 'eu'))`). This caused a cache miss in [`test_repeated_lookup`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/test_cache.py#L10-L20).\n\nAdditionally, [`pkg/parser.py`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/parser.py) was missing the implementation of [`parse_duration`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/parser.py#L16-L31), preventing the full test suite from passing during pytest collection.\n\n---\n\n### Fixes Applied\n\n1. **[`pkg/cache.py`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/cache.py#L4-L5)**:\n   Updated [`_key`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/cache.py#L4-L5) to sort dictionary items (`tuple(sorted(spec.items()))`), ensuring canonical keys regardless of dictionary insertion order.\n\n2. **[`pkg/parser.py`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/parser.py#L16-L31)**:\n   Implemented [`parse_duration`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/parser.py#L16-L31) to convert duration strings into seconds and raise `ValueError` for malformed input.\n\n3. No test files were modified.\n\n---\n\n### Verification\n\nRan `python -m pytest -v` across the entire test suite:\n\n```\ncollected 8 items\n\ntest_cache.py::test_basic_roundtrip PASSED                               [ 12%]\ntest_cache.py::test_repeated_lookup PASSED                               [ 25%]\ntest_parser.py::test_seconds PASSED                                      [ 37%]\ntest_parser.py::test_minutes PASSED                                      [ 50%]\ntest_parser.py::test_compound PASSED                                     [ 62%]\ntest_parser.py::test_malformed_raises PASSED                             [ 75%]\ntest_smoke.py::test_build_url_default PASSED                             [ 87%]\ntest_smoke.py::test_health PASSED                                        [100%]\n\n============================== 8 passed in 0.04s ==============================\n```\n","duration_seconds":110.1487454,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":288321,"output_tokens":9582,"thinking_tokens":6098,"cache_read_tokens":558433,"total_tokens":297903}}
